      "string_id": "companion_hire_dialog_freedom_8",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No, man, there's enough people with you already. Don't want to share my weed with them.",
      "JA_current": "No, man, there's enough people with you already. Don't want to share my weed with them.",
      "JA_new": "いや、もう十分連れがいるだろ。連中と草を分け合いたくないね。",
